        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. EXTENSIONALITY: Two sets are equal iff they have the same elements.\n     A = B  ⟺  ∀x (x ∈ A ⟺ x ∈ B)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-GROUPS-SETS-ALGEBRA.md#010",
      "path": [
